Configure Claude Code's PreToolUse interceptor to scan file edits and command executions before applying code changes:

Create `.claude/settings.json`:

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/claude-settings.json",
  "hooks": {
    "preToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": {
          "tool": "FileEdit|WriteFile",
          "params": {
            "path": ".*\\.(py|sql)$"
          }
        },
        "command": "uv run cig-hook --strict"
      },
      {
        "matcher": {
          "tool": "Bash",
          "params": {
            "command": ".*(python|pytest|dbt).*"
          }
        },
        "command": "uv run cig-hook --file tests/test_econml_dml.py --graph .cig/cig_graph.json"
      }
    ]
  },
  "env": {
    "CIG_STRICT_MODE": "1",
    "CIG_GRAPH_PATH": ".cig/cig_graph.json"
  }
}